  "summary": "Reviewed the complete canonical study, The Gift We Share, and its 20-page proof at build/tpt-runs/8f4e6454c021280a/artifacts/study-review-0/proof/study.pdf. Its three substantial readings each engage the full formulary, both Communion alternatives and all four senses, with meaningful contributions from multiple Fathers or saints. Independently checked relevant Scripture, Augustine, Chrysostom, Gregory, Aquinas, Jerome, Irenaeus and Bellarmine loci, the dated USCCB readings, and liturgical witnesses at their stated evidentiary levels. No substantive source, doctrinal, coverage or visual defect was identified. Complete official 2008 Latin/2011 U.S. altar-book collation and original-language collation of the retained NPNF English remain unperformed and are not claimed. CHANGES_REQUIRED for one recurring study-owned editorial defect. Detailed verification is recorded in .scratch/no-production/study-review-0/verification.md."
